  description: "[ Pendulum Effect ] \nOnce per turn, if your \"Performapal\" monster
    battles an opponent's monster, before damage calculation: You can make that opponent's
    monster lose ATK equal to the difference between its original ATK and current
    ATK (even if this card leaves the field).\n\n[ Monster Effect ] \nDuring either
    player's turn: You can target 1 \"Performapal\" monster whose current ATK is
    different from its original ATK; it gains ATK equal to the difference until the
    end of this turn. You can only use this effect of \"Performapal Barracuda\" once
    per turn."
